 emotion, belting vocals, layered harmonies)\n所有人都在与自己的无价值对抗！\n在平凡的泥沼里 渴望被命运发赏\n眼泪不是懦弱 那是成年人的倔强\n所有人都在与自己的无价值对抗！\n在一次次跌倒后 拍拍灰尘又奔忙\n别怕不够好 别怕满身是伤\n我们在挣扎中 就是活着最美的模样\n\n[Bridge]\n(Dramatic shift, isolated high-pitch vocal with strings)\n每一次破碎 都在重塑坚强\n每一滴眼泪 都在冲刷着彷徨\n别向自卑投降——！\n(High note sustained / 极限高音爆发)\n平凡的我们 也值得万丈光芒——！\n\n[Guitar & Strings Solo]\n(Epic, emotionally charged instrumental solo)\n\n[Final Chorus]\n(Maximum intensity, triumphant but emotional)\n所有人都在与自己的无价值对抗！\n在这漫长的一生 拥抱真实的荒唐\n破碎又怎样 那是光照进的地方！\n所有人都在与自己的无价值对抗\n带着满身的泥泞 也要骄傲地绽放\n不再去证明 不再卑微躲藏\n你本身就是无价 你就是光芒\n\n[Outro]\n(Music strips back to just the soft piano)\n(Gentle, whispering female vocal)\n不再对抗...\n试着原谅...\n你就是光芒...\n(Fading out slowly, lingering echo)"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "id": 5, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "properties": {"cnr_id": "ComfyUI_Comfyroll_CustomNodes", "ver": "d78b780ae43fcf8c6b7c6505e6ffb4584281ceca", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [270, 112], "pos": [2469.371826171875, 1065.632568359375], "widgets_values": ["audio/ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 10, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "label": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "audioUI"}], "flags": {}, "id": 7, "type": "SaveAudio", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.65", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveAudio"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [416.5064392089844, 162.54901123046875], "pos": [2473.8369140625, 776.9315185546875], "widgets_values": ["audio/ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 9, "label": "audio", "